592186045417] [17592186559807 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559807 #edb/ref 1071 "What are the coordinates of the minimum point of the function $y=(x+5)^{2}+3?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559807 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "52805580-1159-55ea-b90b-d6e5fe978449" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559807 #edb/ref 1074 "Remember that the graph of $y=(x-h)^{2}+k$ is a translation of the standard parabola $y={x}^{2}$ by\n\n- $h$ units right, and\n\n- $k$ units up.\n\nThe vertex of $y=(x-h)^{2}+k$ is located at $(h,k).$\n\nHere, the parabola is translated $5$ units *left*, so we have $h=-5.$ The parabola is also translated $3$ units *up*, so we have $k=3.$ \n\n![](images/25/25221241ae83ee4bf78c712ea70d8e4cabea2cb569f59be3122412bbb2cae886.png)\n\nThe vertex is located at $(-5,3),$ and these are the coordinates of the minimum point." #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559881 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186559716 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559881 #edb/ref 1069 "q-105993" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559881 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559881 #edb/ref 1071 "Which of the following is the graph of $y={x}^{2}+2?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559881 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "efac71ed-19b4-5792-ad4d-1b9a5a0c61f5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559881 #edb/ref 1074 "In general, the graph of $y={x}^{2}+k$ looks like the standard parabola $y={x}^{2}$ but translated $k$ units up. The vertex of $y={x}^{2}+k$ is located at $(0,k).$\n\nIn the given function $y={x}^{2}+2,$ we have $k=2.$\n\nTherefore, the given curve is the parabola $y={x}^{2}$ after being translated $2$ units *up*. The vertex is located at $(0,2).$\n\n![](images/c6/c6e9f0867c9b5c04ed1390b01ece62d1fb33673e1e17373a92b2b2d576aeae05.png)" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559918 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186559937 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559918 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "3eba1d14-5e59-5593-ae5f-1e6a34da31f5" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559918 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186559807 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559937 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "625a33d7-26f2-57a4-b96c-ea3ad102fd72" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559937 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186559881 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559956 #edb/ref 1058 #edb/ref 17592186559918 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559956 #edb/ref 1062 #uuid "9a92d698-ec86-5778-ba91-fdbd7435c43c" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186559956 #edb/ref 1063 #edb/ref 17592186069165 #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
